<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #1A1A2E; color: #e0e0e0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { background: #E94560; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    .streak-number { font-size: 64px; font-weight: bold; color: #F59E0B; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
    .content { padding: 30px; }
    .content p { line-height: 1.6; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #E94560; color: #fff; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 30px; text-align: center; color: #888; font-size: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Your streak is at risk!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <div class="streak-number">{{currentStreak}} days</div>
      <p>Hey {{username}}, you haven't studied today yet. Don't let your <strong>{{currentStreak}}-day streak</strong> go to waste!</p>
      <p>Even a quick 15-minute session is enough to keep it alive.</p>
      <a href="{{frontendUrl}}" class="btn">Study Now</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>GYM-STUDY - Consistency is everything</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
